# Regression + Power BI Prediction Dashboard

## Business Problem

The goal of this project is to build a regression model in Python and visualize actual vs predicted results in Power BI.

## Possible Prediction Target

Option 1: Ticket Resolution Time  
Option 2: Delivery Time  
Option 3: Sales Amount

## Tools Used

- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- scikit-learn
- Power BI

## Model Evaluation Metrics

- MAE
- RMSE
- R²

## Power BI Dashboard Pages

1. Model Summary
2. Actual vs Predicted
3. Error Analysis

## Planned Files

- regression_model.ipynb
- predictions.csv
- prediction_dashboard.pbix
- model_metrics.md
- screenshots/

## Status

In progress
